    "result_text": "The build is green. \n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `initials` field on the owner response. The GET owner endpoint responds via `RespondWithOwner` \u2192 `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`, and `OwnerDto` is generated from `openapi.yml`, so I made two changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an `initials` property (read-only string) to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` computing initials as the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot:\n   ```java\n   Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \".\" +\n   Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \".\"\n   ```\n\nThe new acceptance test (`john`/`smith` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`) passes, and the full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 0 failures).",
